### Dashboard-only third-party imports (separate from main app)

**streamlit** — Quick web UI framework for data dashboards.  
*Used in:* `dashboard/app.py`

**pandas** — Data analysis library for tables and charts.  
*Used in:* `dashboard/app.py`

